'''''Iron Man and His Awesome Friends''''', also known as '''''Marvel's Iron Man and His Awesome Friends''''', is a preschool animated series directed by Michael Dowding, based on characters created by [[Marvel Comics]]. Produced by [[Marvel Studios Animation]] and [[Atomic Cartoons]] as a [[Spin-off (media)|spin-off]] of ''[[Spidey and His Amazing Friends]]'', it features the voices of Mason Blomberg, Lincoln Bonilla, Kapri Ladd, and Aidyn Ahn. Sean Coyle serves as [[showrunner]]. It is the first Iron Man television series since ''[[Iron Man: Armored Adventures]]'' (which also starred a younger version of the titular protagonist) from 2009 to 2012. The series premiered on August 11, 2025 on [[Disney Jr.]] and its first ten episodes premiered on [[Disney+]] the next day.

On July 21, 2026, it was reported that the series will end after a single season of 40 episodes in favor of ''Avengers: Mightiest Friends'', which is slated to premiere in 2027.<ref>{{Cite web |last=Haughton |first=Austin |date=2026-07-21 |title='Marvel's Iron Man and His Awesome Friends' Ending After One Season - WDWNT |url=https://wdwnt.com/2026/07/marvels-iron-man-and-his-awesome-friends-ending-after-one-season/ |access-date=2026-07-21 |website=WDW News Today |language=en-US}}</ref><ref>{{Cite web |last=Palmer |first=Roger |date=2026-07-20 |title="Marvel's Iron Man and his Awesome Friends" To Become "Marvel's Avengers: Mightiest Friends" |url=https://whatsondisneyplus.com/marvels-iron-man-and-his-awesome-friends-to-end-after-one-season/ |access-date=2026-07-22 |website=What's On Disney Plus |language=en-us}}</ref>

==Synopsis==
[[Iron Man|Tony Stark / Iron Man]], [[Ironheart (character)|Riri Williams / Ironheart]], and [[Amadeus Cho|Amadeus Cho / Iron Hulk]] form the Iron Friends, using their intelligence and armored suits to solve problems and protect their city. Each suit enables flight and provides enhanced strength.<ref>{{Cite web |last=Catig |first=Gary |date=July 21, 2025 |title=''Marvel's Iron Man and His Awesome Friends'' trailer: It's time to armor up! |url=https://aiptcomics.com/2025/07/21/iron-man-and-his-awesome-friends-trailer/ |access-date=August 12, 2025 |website=AIPT Comics}}</ref>

